sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant A as 🤖 Agent
    participant MM as 🗂️ Memory Manager
    participant Cache as ⚡ Semantic Cache
    participant DB as 🗄️ Memory DB
    participant LLM as 🧠 LLM

    U->>A: "Book the first restaurant"
    A->>Cache: Check cache
    Cache-->>A: Cache MISS
    A->>MM: build_context(query)
    MM->>DB: Load recent history
    MM->>DB: Retrieve relevant facts
    DB-->>MM: History + Facts
    MM-->>A: Enriched context
    A->>LLM: System prompt + context + query
    LLM-->>A: "Booking Ristorante La Piazza at 7 PM..."
    A->>DB: save_turn (user + assistant)
    A->>Cache: cache_set(query, reply)
    A->>DB: log_tool_call (if any)
    A-->>U: "Booking confirmed at Ristorante La Piazza!"

